{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_25_1653321688#8_3255285796","relevance":2,"reason":"This Patriot Act passage gives direct but incomplete support evidence: Russ Feingold was the only senator to vote against the act and some House members dissented or abstained, but it does not provide the exact House 357–66 or Senate 98–1 vote totals.","learned":"Another source notes the Patriot Act passed very quickly after 9/11 and that Russ Feingold was the only senator to vote against it, though it lacks full vote totals."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q808","reason":"The query found a new related source using sole-Senate-opponent wording; continue to see whether later results include exact House/Senate vote totals and qualify as grade-3 evidence."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q808"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_25_1653321688#7_3255283855","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q808","rank":3,"snippet":"of the Patriot Act contains a number of relatively minor, miscellaneous provisions. Advertisement Primary Criticisms of the Act President George W. Bush signs the Patriot Act into law. Photo courtesy of The White House The Patriot Act has come under fire for a number of reasons. It was passed very quickly (just over a month after the September 11, 2001, terrorist attacks), and Congress spent very little time reading and debating it. By some accounts, less than 48 hours passed between the presentation of the bill’s final wording and the law passing in both houses of Congress, leading to some doubt whether many members of Congress actually read the lengthy and complex bill. However, Sen. <cover>Russ Feingold, a Democrat from Wisconsin, was the only senator to vote against the act, while several members of the House of Representatives joined his dissent or abstained from voting. Critics contend that such a crucial and sweeping piece of legislation deserved more thorough deliberation.\" , \"start_char\": 4776.000000 , \"title\": \"How the Patriot Act </cover>Works | HowStuffWorks\" , \"url\": \"https://people.howstuffworks.com/patriot-act.htm\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_40_1411283596#2_2892646769","rank":2,"relevance":3}]}}
